<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Wakolimso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga wa mwanduso wa Paulo kwa Wakolimso</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Wakolimso</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">USENGA WA MWANDUSO WA PAULO KWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAKOLIMSO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Wakolimso wa mwanduso wandikigwa na Mtumigwa Paulo habehi na mwaka 55 kwandusila viyelekigwe Yesu viilagusigwa muna 1:1. Uno ni usenga wa mwanduso muna zisenga mbili ziya Mtumigwa Paulo kawandikila bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito weli Kolinto. Yodahika kandika usenga uno viyakalile Efeso yang'hali kufika Kolimso muna umwanza wake kuhita Makedoniya viilagusigwa muna 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga uno wokwidika mbuli ziyahokele Mtumigwa Paulo kulawa kwa wanhu wamwenga wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito kusonhela mbuli zihile muna dibumbila na kuibagula na ugoni. Bululu da Kolimso dimanyika ng'hani kwa ugoni wake ivo si mbuli ya kwazanywa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito da uko kutenda mbuli izo. Wakolimso wa mwanduso iviya ina sula yoimanyika ng'hani ya ulondo, sula iyo ni sula ya 13.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeliumo</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Paulo kowalamsa Wakolimso na komwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa ichimu chawo muna 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Kaidi kolonga mbuli ziyapatile kusonhela kuigola kwa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito wa uko Kolimso muna 1:10-4:21.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Maabaho kolonga mbuli ya ugoni na kuigala wawo kwa wawo kuna ichitala muna isula ya 5-6.</para>
  <para style="ili">4. Iviya kolava ndagilizi kusonhela mbuli ya sola, kutambikila nyang'hiti na nhambiko za muumwingi na vitumetume va chimuhe na uzilibuko muna isula ya 7-15.</para>
  <para style="ili">5. Kuuhelelo kogotola kwa kulonga mbuli za zake mwenyewo na mbuli za chila siku muna isula ya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Niye Paulo, yonitangigwe kuwa mtumigwa wa Chilisito Yesu, kwa viyolonda Mulungu, na hamwe na ndugu yetu Sositene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Chojandikila bumbila da wanhu wowomuhuwila Chilisito weli muna dibululu da Kolimso, kwa mweye mose wowasafyigwe na wowatangigwe kuwa wanhu welile wa Mulungu kwa kuilumba na Yesu Chilisito, hamwe na wanhu wose chila hanhu howomtambikila Mndewa wetu Yesu Chilisito, Mndewa wawo na wetu,<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Nompula Mulungu Tati yetu na Mndewa Yesu Chilisito waweng'heni balaka na tindiwalo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaka za kuilumba na Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Siku zose nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa ichimu cha unovu uyaweng'hileni kufosela Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Kwaviya kwa kuilumba hamwe na Chilisito muwa matajili wa vinhu vose, muna ulonzi na umanyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Usenga kusonhela Chilisito wima chigangamavu mgati yenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Ivo hamuhungukiligwe bule kuhokela vitumetume vovose vovilavigwa na Muhe Yelile, fana vimugozela Mndewa wetu Yesu Chilisito yagubuligwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Iviya yeye kezangangamizani mbaka kuuhelelo, muladi mukale bila kuhasanya muna isiku ija ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Mulungu ni mwaminika, iyo yoyamtangileni muilumbe na Mwanage Yesu Chilisito, Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila Woibagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Kwa udaho wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Chilisito nomwing'hani usi ndugu zangu, kuwa wose mulonge zimwe na wala sekemuiswele na mugese dimwe na muwe na lungilo dimwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Kwaviya ndugu zangu, nilongiligwa na wanhu kulawa kwa kaye ya Kiloye kuwa kuna kuleka kwiilumba vimwili. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Nolonga vino, chila imwe wenu kolonga mbasakanyo. Imwe kolonga, “Nomsondelela Paulo”, imwenga kolonga, “Nomsondelela Apolo”, imwenga kolonga, “Nomsondelela Petili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zina jake Petili, yoyatangigwe Kefa</char></note>”, na imwenga, “Nomsondelela Chilisito.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Chilisito haigole muna yamabumbila bule. Paulo hawambigwe mumsalaba kwa ichimu chenu. Hambatizigwe bule fana wanahina wa Paulo.<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwaviya simbatize munhu yoyose imwenga kumwenu ila Chilisipo na Gayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Habule munhu yodaha kulonga mweye mubatizigwa fana wanahina wangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Ona, iviya niwabatiza Sitefano na wanhu wa muikaye yake, mbali sidaha kukumbuka fana nimbatiza munhu imwenga yoyose. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Chilisito hanhumile kubatiza bule. Kanhuma kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile, na siyo kwa ulonzi wa ubala wa chiunhu, muladi nguvu ya ifa ya Chilisito muna umsalaba sekekuwoneke siyo chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chilisito iyo ludabwa na ubala wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kwaviya usenga wa ifa ya Chilisito muna umsalaba wowoneka ubozi kwa waja wowogwaga, mbali kumwetu wochikomboligwe chowona udaho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Kwaviya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Nizaubananga ubala wa wabala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na umanyi wawo nizawasa kutali.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Vino mbala kakulihi? Hebu mfundiza kakulihi? Nayo galu wa ubishi wa lusita luno kakulihi? Mulungu kautenda ubala wa wanhu wa isi yose kuwa ubozi!<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Kwaviya Mulungu kwa ubala wake katenda wanhu sekewadahe kummanya yeye kwa ubala wawo wenyewo. Mbali kwa usenga wa wowoneka kuwa ni ubozi uchiwapetele, Mulungu kalamula kuwakombola waja wohuwila. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Wayahudi wolonda vilaguso va mauzauza. Wagiliki wozahila ubala. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Mbali cheye, chompeta Chilisito yoyawambigwe mumsalaba, mbuli yoiwoneka ching'hwaso kwa Wayahudi, na ubozi kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Mbali kwa waja watangigwe na Mulungu, Wayahudi hamwe na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi, usenga uno ni Chilisito, yeli udaho wa Mulungu na ubala wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Kwaviya chiya chiwoneka ubozi wa Mulungu china ubala kufosa ubala wa wanhu, na chiya chiwoneka chinyondenyonde cha Mulungu ni chigangamavu kufosa ugangamavu wa wanhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Lelo ndugu zangu, kumbukeni vimukalile chipindi vimutangigwe na Mulungu. Wengi wenu mukala mwabule ubala kwa magesa ya wanhu, wengi wenu mukala mwabule nguvu, wala weli na ulangulizi. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Mbali Mulungu kayagesela kuyasagula yaja yowonigwa kuwa yachibozi na ya zisi, muladi yawagume chinyala wene ubala, iviya kayasagula yaja yeli nyondenyonde muladi yawagume chinyala wene nguvu. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Mulungu kasagula vinhu vinyondenyonde va isi na vinhu viya vovizehigwa, vinhu viya voviwoneka si chinhu, muladi kubananga vinhu viya isi voviviwona chinhu ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Ivo Mulungu katenda vino muladi sekehawe na munhu yodaha kwiigoda haulongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Mulungu mwenyewo kawatenda muilumbe na Chilisito Yesu, Mulungu kamtenda Chilisito kuwa ubala wetu. Kufosela yeye chopetigwa chinoga haulongozi ha Mulungu, chokuwa wanhu welile wa Mulungu na chikomboligwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Fana Yamaandiko Yelile viyolonga, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kwiigoda, kolondeka yaigodele yaja yoyatendile Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Chilisito yoyawambigwe mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ndugu zangu, vinizile kumwenu simpeteleni usenga ukweli woufisike kusonhela Mulungu kwa mbuli zozilondeka hebu kwa ubala wa wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Kwaviya vinikalile kumwenu, nilonda kuleka chila chinhu ila Yesu Chilisito, hasa ifa yake mumsalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Vinizile kumwenu, nikala nyondenyonde na nigudemeka kwa kudumba ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Mafundizo yangu na usenga wangu havikalile va kunogeza kwa ubala wa chiunhu, mbali kwa kulagusa ludabwa wa Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Muladi uhuwilo wenu sekeuwe na ubala wa chiunhu, mbali ludabwa lwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubala wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Nopeta usenga wa ubala kwa wanhu wowakangale chimuhe. Mbali si ubala wa lusita luno, hebu wa watawala weli na nguvu wa lusita luno, wowokwagiza nguvu zawo. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Ubala woniupeta ni ubala wa sili ya Mulungu, ubala uwo woufisike. Woyausagule kwa ichimu cha utunhizo wetu ing'hali isi yose hainalumbigwa bule. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Habule watawala wa lusita luno woumanyile ubala uno. One waumanyile, sigambe wamuwambe bule mumsalaba Mndewa wa utunhizo. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Mbali fana Yamaandiko Yelile viyolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Habule munhu yaziwone wala kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">habule munhu yagesile kuwa zizalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">chila chinhu Mulungu chiyawasasalile waja wowomulonda yeye.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Mbali Mulungu katenda sili yake imanyike kumwetu kwa nzila ya Muhe Yelile. Muhe Yelile kopekula chila chinhu, hata vovifisigwe kusonhela Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Habule munhu yodaha kuvimanya magesa ya munhu imwenga ila Muhe wa munhu yoyokala mgati yake, iviya habule munhu yovimanya magesa ya Mulungu ila Muhe wa Mulungu muhala. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Cheye hachihokele muhe wa isi ino, mbali chihokela Muhe yatumigwe na Mulungu, muladi chivimanye yose yoching'higwe bule na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Ivo cholonga, si kwa mbuli zochifundizigwe kwa ubala wa wanhu, mbali kwa mbuli zochifundizigwe na Muhe Yelile, chofambula vinhu va kweli va Muhe Yelile kwa waja weli na Muhe ino. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Munhu yoyose yelibule Muhe Yelile hadaha kuhokela vinhu vovilawa kwa Muhe Yelile. Munhu fana iyo hazimanya bule mbuli izo, kowona ubozi, kwaviya yodaha kumanyika kwa kutazigwa na Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Mbali munhu yoyose yeli na Muhe Yelile, kodaha kumanya vinhu vose, mbali habule munhu yoyose yodaha kumulamulila nhaguso. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Fana viya Yamaandiko Yelile viyolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Vino yelihi yoyovimanya chiyogesa Mndewa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Yelihi yoyodaha kumulongela cha kulonga?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Mbali cheye china nzewele za Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila woigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Ndugu zangu niye sidahile kulonga na mweye fana wanhu weli na Muhe wa Mulungu, mbali nilonga na mweye fana wanhu wa chiisi na fana wana wadoododo muna uhuwilo ya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Ivo nimwing'hani matombo, si ndiya ndala, kwaviya mukala hamuidaha. Mbaka sambi mung'hali hamuidaha bule. <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>Kwaviya mung'hali mokala fana wanhu wa isi ino viwokala. Kwaviya muna migongo na ndwagi wenyewo kwa wenyewo, yolagusa kuwa molangulizigwa na isi, mukale kuinzana na ugima wa chiunhu. <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Munhu imwe yahalonga, “Niye nomsondelela Paulo”, na imwenga yahalonga, “Niye nomsondelela Apolo” ivo mweye wose hamtenda fana wanhu wa isi ino viwotenda?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Lelo, Apolo iyo yelihi? Na Paulo iyo yelihi? Cheye iyo wasang'hani wa Mulungu, wochimgalileni mweye uhuwilo. Chila imwe wetu kosang'hana usang'hano uyeng'higwe na Mndewa, <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>niye nihanda mbeyu, Apolo kaigumila mazi, mbali Mulungu iyo yaitendile ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Ivo muhandaji si chinhu na wala ngumilaji mazi si chinhu. Mbali Mulungu iyo chinhu, kwaviya iyo yoyoitendeza ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Ivo muhandaji na ngumilaji mazi habule mbasakanyo, mbali Mulungu kezamuliha chila imwe kwa kuwinzana viya viyasang'hane usang'hano wake. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Kwaviya cheye cha wamwe, wasang'hani hamwe na Mulungu, na mweye ni mgunda wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Mweye iviya ni fana zengo da Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Kwa kuwinzana na unovu wa Mulungu uning'higwe fana mkulu wa uzenzi mwene ubala, nika chandusilo na munhu imwenga kozenga. Mbali chila munhu nayalole viya vondayazenge uchanyha yake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kwaviya habule chandusilo chimwenga chochidaha kuzengwa, Mulungu komwika Yesu Chilisito fana chandusilo. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Uchanya ya chandusilo icho munhu kodaha kusang'hanila zahabu, hela hebu mabwe ya hela nyingi, hebu kodaha kusang'hanila mibiki, hebu mabuwa hebu masavu. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Kwaviya unovu wa chila usang'hano wa munhu wizawoneka Zuwa da Chilisito. Vondadize Zuwa ijo, moto wizaigeza chila sang'hano ya munhu na kulagusa unovu sang'hano yake. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Ihawa munhu chiyazengile uchanyha ya chandusilo icho chizausitamili moto, mzenzi kezahokela gweko. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Mbali fana chiyazengile chihalungula, maabaho kezakwagiza gweko jake, mbali yeye mwenyewo kezakomboligwa, fana kahongela kufosela kuumoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Mweye mvimanya kuwa ni Kaye ya Mulungu na Muhe wa Mulungu kokala mgati mmwenu. <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Fana munhu yoyose yahaibananga Kaye ya Mulungu, Mulungu kezambananga munhu iyo. Kwaviya Kaye ya Mulungu yela, na mweye ni fana Kaye ya Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Sekemwiivwizile! Munhu yoyose kumwenu yahaiwona mwene ubala wa isi, muhavu mulekeni yawe mbozi, muladi yapate kuwa na ubala wa kweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Kwaviya ubala wa wanhu wa isi ino ni ubozi haulongozi wa Mulungu. Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Mulungu kowagwila wene ubala muna ujanja wawo”, <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>kaidi Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Mndewa kovimanya kuwa magesa ya wene ubala si chinhu.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Mbali munhu yoyose sekeyaigodele chiya chowodaha kutenda wanhu. Kwaviya vinhu vose ni venu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Paulo hebu Apolo hebu Kefa, isi ino hebu ugima hebu ifa, vinhu va lusita lono hebu vinhu vikwiza. Vino vose ni venu, <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>na mweye ni wanhu wa Chilisito, na Chilisito ni wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Munhu yachiwone cheye iyo wasang'hani wa Chilisito, wowokwika goya vinhu vovifisigwe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Na chilondeka kwa yoyose ija yokwika goya ni kwaminika. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Mbali kumwangu niye siyo chinhu kutagusigwa na mweye hebu wanhu wamwenga wala siitagusa niye mwenyewo. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Kwaviya siwona chimu cha kumulongeleza mwenyewo muna umoyo wangu, mbali iyo hailagusa kuwa ninoga haulongozi wa Mulungu. Mndewa iyo yonda yanilamulile nhaguso. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Ivo sekemumulamulile nhaguso munhu yoyose ing'hali lusita halunafika, na gozeleni mbaka Mndewa vondayeze. Yeye kezagala bung'hulo muna diziza zozifisigwe na kulagusa magesa ya mizoyo ya wanhu. Baho chila munhu kezahokela nhogolwa imfaya kulawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Ndugu zangu, kwa ichimu chenu nizitenda mbuli zino ziwe simwe da niye na Apolo, muladi kwa simwe jetu mupate kuifunza sekemfose yaja yandikigwe, muladi imwe wenu sekeyaigode kwa ichimu cha ino na kumwehula imwenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Sekemugese kuwa muna mbasakanyo na wamwenga. Mulungu kakwing'ha vinhu vose viwilinavo. Sekewiigode, fana hunahokela bule.<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Mogesa mumala kupata chila chinhu chomulonda. Mogesa muwa matajili mumala. Mogesa muwa wafalume, ingawa cheye siyo. Vinoga, nowalondeleni muwe wafalume wa kweli, muladi na cheye chiwe wafalume hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Nogesa Mulungu kachitenda cheye watumigwa chiwe wanhu wa kulukomelezo ng'hani, fana wanhu watagusigwe kukomigwa. Chikigwa fana wanhu wa kusangazigwa haulongozi wa isi yose na wasenga wa Mulungu na wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Cheye chawabozi kwa ichimu cha kumsang'hanila Chilisito, mbali mweye mwawabala muna ukuilumba na Chilisito! Cheye chawanyondenyonde na mweye muna nguvu, iviya mweye mohishimika mbali cheye chokwehuligwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Mbaka sambi cheye china nzala na ng'hilu, chabule viwalo na chotowigwa ng'hani, na chabule hanhu ha kukala. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Chogaya na kusang'hana usang'hano kwa makono yetu wenyewo, na chahaduwiligwa chowatemela mate na chihagazigwa chofunya umoyo, <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Chahavwiziligwa chokwidika vinogile. Mbaka sambi cheye chowoneka fana unyolodo wa isi na unyolodo wa vinhu vose.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Siwandikileni usenga uno kwa ichimu cha kungumani chinyala, mbali kwa ichimu cha kuwazumha fana wanangu walondwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Hata one muhawa na ndoleizi maalufu longo muna ugima wenu wa Chichilisito, mwabule tata wengi. Kwaviya muna ugima wenu muna ukuilumba na Chilisito Yesu niwa tati yenu kwa kuwapeteleni Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Nomulambani muwinze simwe jangu. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Lekamana nimtuma Timoseyo kumwenu, yeli mwanangu mulondwa mwaminika muna ukuilumba na Mndewa na kezamkumbusani nzila iniinzile niye muna ukuilumba na Chilisito, nzila ija inifundiza chila hanhu muna gamabumbila ga wanhu womuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Wamwenga wenu wandusa kuigoda wagesa siza kaidi kumulaulani. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Mbali Mndewa yahalonda nize kumwenu, nizakwiza sambi, na baho nizawona mwenyewo ludabwa lwa magoda yawelinayo wanhu, na chiwolonga. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Kwaviya Ufalume wa Mulungu si mbuli ya kulonga, mbali ni ludabwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Molondeka kusagula. Nize kumwenu na balati hebu nize na muhe wa ulondo na uhole? Nogesa molonda nize na ulondo na uhole.<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Uzinzi muna dibumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Kuna mbuli za kwaminika kuwa kumwenu kuna uzinzi, na iviya uzinzi wihile na haunawahi kuwa uko hata muna iwanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. Nilongeligwa munhu komwangala mami yake wa kuvikila. <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Na mweye moigoda. Mbali molondeka muwe na usungu, na munhu yatendile mbuli iyo yasegezigwe kumwenu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Hata ingawa kwa lukuli nakutali na mweye mbali kwa muhe nahabehi na mweye, ivo kwaviya nabaho nimtagusa nimala munhu iyo yatendile mbuli iyo, fana viya nabaho. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Muhaiting'hana hamwe kwa zina da Mndewa Yesu, na niye noiting'hana na mweye muna yamagesa yangu, kwa ludabwa lwa Mndewa wetu Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>mwing'heni Lufyende munhu iyo muladi lukuli lwake lubanangigwe, na muhe wake udahe kukomboligwa muna Isiku ya Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Magoda yenu hayanogile. Vino hamuvimanyile kuwa lusu chidogo dogongomola bonge jose da usage? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Molondeka kudisegeza lusu da umwaka muladi muwe bonge da sambi dili hadinagumigwa lusu fana vimulondeka kuwa, kwaviya Chilisito kalavigwa fana mwana ng'hondolo wa Pasaka. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Lelo chitende dugila da Pasaka, siyo kwa lusu diya da umwaka na lusu da wihi na uhasanyi, mbali kwa gate hadigumigwe lusu na gate da kusafya na ukweli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Muna usenga umwenga wonimwandikileni nimulongelani sekemuihanganye na wanhu wazinzi. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Ivo silonga kuwa sekemuihanganye ng'hani na wanhu hawamuhuwila Mulungu weli wazinzi hebu wene kutamani, hebu wahokaji, hebu wene kutambikila nyang'hiti. Kwaviya molondeka kulawa muna isi muladi muyepule nawo. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Chinyandika niye cha vino, sekemuihanganye na munhu yoitanga mwenyewo muhuwila wa Chilisito mbali ni mzinzi hebu ngila hebu yotambikila nyang'haiti hebu muligaji hebu mulevi hebu mbavi. Hata sekemukale na kuja na munhu fana iyo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Sidaha kuwalamulila nhaguso wanhu weli kunze ya uhuwilo! Cholondeka kuwalamulila nhaguso wahuwila muhala. <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Mulungu kezalamula nhaguso ilihi kwa wanhu weli kunze ya uhuwilo. Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Muwingeni munhu yehile muna dibumbila jenu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kuilongeleza kwa ndugu wahuwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>One imwe wenu yahaiswela na muhuwila miyage, kogezaze kuhita kumulamulila nhaguso haulongozi ha wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu badala ya kumshitaki haulongozi ha wanhu welile. <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Molondeka muvimanye kuwa wanhu wa Mulungu wezalamula nhaguso kwa wanhu wa isi yose. One mwizalamula nhaguso ilihi kwa wanhu wa isi yose, maabaho molondeka mudahe kulamula nhaguso ilihi kwa mbuli ndodo. <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Molondeka muvimanye kuwa chizawalamulila nhaguso wasenga wa kuulanga. Mbali mbuli za ugima uno siyo chinhu chikulu! <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Muhawa na migomvi kwa mbuli za kawaida, hata mowatanga wasemi waja hawahishimigwa muna yamabumbila ya wahuwila. <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nolonga ivo muladi nimgumeni chinyala. Mowatanga wawo wasemi, hata hawahishimigwa na wahuwila. Kumwenu kwa bule hata munhu imwe yeli na ubala yodaha kulamula hagati ya wahuwila. <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Mbali, muhuwila imwe kongala mchilisito kuna ichitala na wowaleka wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu walamule nhaguso.<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Kwa kweli uko kuilongeleza mweye kwa mweye kolagusa kuwa mupotigwa ng'hani! Ihawile muhavu ng'hani mweye kubunzigwa. Ihawile muhavu ng'hani mweye kuhokigwa! <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Mbali mweye wenyewo moibunza na kuitendela yehile, na mowatendela yano ndugu zenu. <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Mweye muvimanya kuwa wanhu wotenda yehile hawezakwingila muna Ufalume wa Mulungu. Sekemwiivwizile wenyewo! Wanhu wokala na ugima wa kuyangala chakachaka na watambikila nyang'hiti na wazinzi hebu walawiti, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>hebu wabavi na wagila na walevi na waligaji, wanhu wawo wose haweza kwingila muna Ufalume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Wamwenga wenu mukala ivo. Mbali musafyigwa kulawa muna uhasanyi, mutendigwa muwe welile na mopetigwa munoga haulongozi wa Mulungu kwa zina da Mndewa Yesu Chilisito na kwa Muhe wa Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hanileni ng'huli zenu kwa utunhizo wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Imwenga kezalonga, “Nitogoleligwa kutenda chila chinhu.” Ona, mbali siyo chila chinhu chinoga kumwenu. Nodaha kulonga kuwa notogoleligwa kutenda chinhu chochose, mbali silonda kutawaligwa na chinhu chochose. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Munhu imwenga kezalonga, “Ndiya kwa munda, na munda kwa ndiya.” Ona, mbali Mulungu kezavibananga vili muna umunda na ndiya. Lukuli lwa munhu siyo kwa ichimu cha ugoni ila kwa ichimu cha kumsang'hanila Mndewa, na Mndewa iyo yowika goya lukuli. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Mulungu kamzilibula Mndewa, na cheye iviya kezachizilibula kwa ludabwa lwake.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Muvimanya kuwa ng'huli zenu ni viungo va lukuli lwa Chilisito. Mogesa nodaha kusola chilungo cha lukuli lwa Chilisito na kulutenda lukuli luihanganye na malaya? Haidahika bule! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Muvimanya kuwa munhu yoilumba lukuli lwake na malaya wezakuwa fana munhu imwe. Kwaviya viyandikikwe muna Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Wanhu waidi wezakuwa lukuli lumwe.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Mbali munhu yailumbile mwenyewo na Mndewa kokuwa hamwe nayo chimuhe.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Muyepule ng'hani na ugoni. Uhasanyi umwenga wose uyotenda munhu kunze ya lukuli lwake, mbali munhu yotenda ugoni kolutendela uhasanyi lukuli lwake mwenyewo. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Molondeka muvimanye kuwa ng'huli zenu ni kaye ya Muhe Yelile yokala mgati yenu, na yomwing'higwe na Mulungu. Mweye si wenyewo, mbali wa Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>kawagula kwa bei ng'hulu ng'hani. Ivo sang'hanileni ng'huli zenu kwa ukulu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya sola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Lelo kwa mbuli ziya zimwandike kuwa. “Vinoga msaka sekeyasole”. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Mbali kwaviya kuna ugoni, chila mulume kolondeka yawe na muke wake mwenyewo, na chila muke kolondeka yawe na mulumake mwenyewo. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Mulume yatende yaja yoyolondeka yamtendele muke wake, na muke yatende yaja yoyolonda mulumake. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Muke kabule udaho na lukuli lwake mwenyewo mbali mulumake kanayo, iviya mulume kabule udaho na lukuli lwake mwenyewo mbali muke wake kanayo. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Sekemwiime, ila teng'hu muitogolele kutenda ivo lusita ludodo, muladi mupate nyafasi inogile ya kutosa. Maabaho ibweleleni kaidi, muladi Lufyende sekeyamgezeni kwa ichimu cha kupotwa kuilanguliza kwenu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Yano yonimulongelani ni magesa yangu, si malagilizo. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Nolonda wanhu wose wawe fana vinili niye, mbali chila munhu chitumetume chake kulawa kwa Mulungu, munhu imwe kana chitumetume chino, imwenga kana chiya.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Lelo kwa waja weli wasaka na wagane nolonga kuwa muhavu wagendelele kukala bila ya kusola fana vinili niye. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Mbali one hamudaha kuzikimilila tamaa zenu za lukuli, soleni, kwaviya muhavu kusola kufosa kwaka tamaa za lukuli.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Kwa wanhu wasolile noweng'ha lagilizo dino, dino si jangu bule mbali da Mndewa, muke sekeyamuleke mulumake, <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>mbali one yahatenda ivo, kolondeka yasigale mgane hebu yailumbe na mulumake, na mulume kolondeka sekeyamwing'he chibuwa cha nyasa muke wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Kwa wanhu wamwenga nowalongela, niye mwenyewo, siyo Mndewa, one mulume yomuhuwila Chilisito yahawa na muke hahuwila na katogola kukala nayo, sekeyeyamwing'he chibuwa cha nyasa. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Na one muke yomuhuwila Chilisito yahasoligwa na mulume hahuwila na kaitogolela kukala nayo, sekeyamwase. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Mulume hahuwila kotogoligwa na Mulungu kwa kuilumba na mke wake, na muke hahuwila kotogoligwa na Mulungu kwa kuilumba na mulumake. One siivo wana wawo wahawile wambula mwiko, Mbali kwa ichimu chino, wokwela. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Mbali ija hahuwila yahalonda kusegela nayasegele. Baho mulume iyo hebu muke iyo hafungika. Kwaviya Mulungu kamtangani mweye mukale kwa tindiwalo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Weye muke muhuwila, hudaha kuvimanya kuwa hwizamkombola mulume wako. Na weye mulume muhuwila, hudaha kuvimanya kuwa hwizamkombola muke wako.<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kala fana Mulungu woyakutangile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Chila munhu nayakale kuwinzana fana Mulungu viyeng'higwe na Mndewa, na fana viyatangigwe na Mulungu. Dino ijo kanuni donifundiza kwa wahuwila wose. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Ihawa munhu kengizigwa ulungwana vayatangigwe na Mulungu sekeyalonde kusegeza ng'hovu ya ulungwana. Ihawa kakala hanakwingizigwa ulungwana viyatangiwe na Mulungu, halondeka kwingizigwa ulungwana. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Kwaviya kwingizigwa ulungwana hebu kuleka kwingizigwa ulungwana si chinhu, mbali chinhu cha mana ni kutegeleza malagilizo ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Vinoga chila munhu nayakale fana viya viyakalile chipindi viyatangigwe na Mulungu, fana kasola yasigale ivo ivo hebu hanasola yasigale ivo ivo. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Vino! Weye kukala mtumwa lusita viutangingwe? Na Mulungu kukala mtumwa. Vinoga, sekeugese, mbali one uhawa na nyafasi ya kuwa na ulegeho, usang'hanile uwo, <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Kwaviya mtumwa yoyatangigwe na Mndewa. Iviya viya kailegeha kwa Mndewa, viyatangigwe na Chilisito muna utumwa wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Mulungu kangulani mweye kwa bei ng'hulu, ivo sekemuwe watumwa wa wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Ivo ndugu zangu chila munhu nayakale kwa kuilumba na Mulungu fana viyakalile lusita viyatangigwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuza ya wanhu hawanasola na wagane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Mbali kwa mbuli ya mhambe na wagane, nabule lagilizo kulawa kwa Mndewa, mbali nolava malaguso yangu niye nili kwa ubazi wa Mndewa nolondeka kuhuwiligwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Kwa ichimu cha uzidilwa uchili nawo, nogesa vinoga kwa munhu kukala fana viyeli. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>One weye kusola, sekeugeze kumuleka. One weye hunasola, sekeuzahile muke. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Mbali uhasola kokuwa hutendile uhasanyi na mhambe yahasoligwa hatenda uhasanyi bule. Mbali wawo wondawamsole wezapatigwa na uzidilwa wa isi ino, mbali niye nolonda yayo sekeyampateni mweye.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonga vino, lusita lusigale ni luguhi, kwandusila sambi na kugendelela waja weli na wanaake na wawe fana wabule, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>na waja wolila na wawe fana hawalila, waja wodeng'helela na wawe fana hawadeng'helela, wagulaji na wawe fana wabule chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>Na waja wosang'hanila vinhu va isi ino, wawe fana wabule sang'hano nayo, kwaviya isi ino, fana vichiimanya, yofosa.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nolonda mweye sekemuwe na ludumbo. Munhu yelibule muke komsang'hanila Mndewa, kwaviya kogeza kumnogeza Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Mbali mulume yasolile kosang'hanila mbuli za isi ino, kwaviya kolonda yamnogeze muke wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>na konogelwa na vinhu vidi. Iviya yauko mbasakanyo hagati ya muke hanasoligwa hebu mhambe. Mwanamke hanasoligwa kosang'hanila mbuli za Mndewa muladi yapate kwela lukuli lwake na muhe wake. Mbali muke yasoligwe kosang'hanila mbuli za isi ino, kwaviya kolonda kumnogeza mulumake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nolonga vino kwaviya nolonda kumtazani. Silonda kuwakimilila. Nolonda mutende mbuli zinogile na zifaya kumsang'hanila Mndewa bila ya ching'hwaso.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>One munhu yahagesa hamtendela vinogile mhambe wake, fana hamsolile, fana tamaa zake zihamwingila basi nayatende viyolonda, waisole. Hatenda uhasanyi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Mbali fana mulume iyo yahalamula bila shuluti muumoyo wake kuleka kusola na fana yahadaha kuzikimila tamaa zake na kulamula va kutenda, ivo kotenda goya ng'hani fana hamsolile mhambe iyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Kwa mbuli zimwenga, munhu yosagula kusola mhambe kotenda vinogile, munhu yosagula kuleka kusola kotenda vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Muke yasoligwe kokuwa kafungigwa lusita lose na mulumake yahawa ngima, mbali mulumake yahadanganika, muke iyo kailegeha na yahalonda kodaha kusoligwa na mulume imwenga yoyose, mbali yawe muhuwila. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Mbali viniwona niye, muke iyo kezamweda one yahakala yaidumwe. Na nogesa kuwa na niye iviya nina Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ilavigwe sadaka kwa nyang'hiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Kwa mbuli ya vinhu vilavigwe sadaka kwa nyang'hiti, chivimanya kuwa cheye chose china umanyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Umanyi wogala magoda, mbali ulondo wozenga. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Waja wogesa kuwa wovimanya chila chinhu hawavimanyile fana viwolondeka kuvimanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Mbali munhu yomulonda Mulungu kamanyika na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Ivo kusonhela kuja ndiya itambikiligwe nyang'hiti, chovimanya kuwa nyang'hiti si chinhu bule muna isi yose, na chomanya kuwa kuna Mulungu imwe muhala. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Hata one kuhawa na vinhu vitangigwa “milungu” iwe kuulanga hebu muna isi, na hata one kuna milungu wengi na wandewa wengi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>kweli kumwetu kuna Mulungu imwe muhala, Tata, Mulumbaji wa vinhu vose na cheye chokala kwa ichimu chake, na kuna Mndewa imwe muhala, Yesu Chilisito, kufosela yeye vinhu vose vilumbigwa na cheye chokala kwa nzila yake. <verse eid="1CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Mbali siyo chila munhu kaumanya ukweli uno. Wanhu wamwenga wotambikila nyang'hiti mbaka sambi wahaja ndiya wogesa kuwa ndiya ija ilavigwe sadaka kwa nyang'hiti, kwaviya malungilo yawo manyonde nyonde hata kugeligwa mwiko. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Mbali ndiya haidaha kuchigala habehi na Mulungu. Ivo chahaleka kuja hachihungukilwa na chinhu, na chahaja hachongezekeligwa na chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Muiteganye muladi ulegeho wenu sekeuwatende wanyondenyonda wa uhuwilo wagwe muna uhasanyi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Kwaviya munhu yahakuwona weye uli na umanyi kukala hasi haindiya mgati muna ikaye ya kutambikila nyang'hiti, munhu yeli na lungilo nyondenyonde muna umoyo kezagumigwa moyo wa kuja ndiya iyo itambikiligwe nyang'hiti. <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Na vino kwa ichimu cha umanyi wako, ndugu ija yeli na uhuwilo nyondenyonde Chilisito yoyadanganike kwa ichimu chake, kezakwaga. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>One muhawahasanya na ndugu zenu fana ivo na kwagiza lungilo jawo nyondenyonde na mwizakuwa mumuhasanya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Ivo fana ndiya yomtenda ndugu yangu yahasanye, sizakuja nyama ng'o! Muladi sekenimtende ndugu yangu yatende uhasanyi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano za watumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Vino niye siigehe? Vino niye si mtumigwa? Vino niye simuone Mndewa? Mweye siyo matunda ya sang'hano yangu kwa Mndewa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Hata fana niye si mtumigwa kwa wamwenga, mbali kumwenu niye ni mtumigwa. Mweye mwawakalangama wa utumigwa wangu kwaviya muilumba na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Wanhu wahaniuza, nizaigombela fana vino, <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>vino hachilondeka kuja na kung'wa kwa ichimu cha usang'hano wetu? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Vino hachilondeka kuhiga masimwe ya watumigwa wamwenga na masekulu zake Mndewa na Kefa, kwa kuilongoza na mwanamke yohuwila muna imiyanza yetu. <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Si niye muhala na Balinaba wochilondeka kupata vinhu vovilondeka muna ugima wetu kwa kusang'hana usang'hano. <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Mwanajeshi kolihigwa kwa usang'hano wake kudijeshi. Mulimi koja matunda ya mgunda wake wa mizabibu. Mdimi kong'wa matombo ya bumbila da fugo yake.<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Silonga mbuli zino chiunhu, Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa yolonga ivo. <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Yandikigwa muna Yamalagilizo ya Musa, “Sekeumzibe ng'ombe mulomo wake vonda yahwage uhemba.” Iyo si kulonga kuwa Mulungu kowagesa ng'ombe muhala. <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Vino hakalile yochigesa cheye viyalongile ivo? Ona! Yandikigwa kwa ichimu chetu. Munhu yohanda na munhu yolima wolondeka kulolela kupata hanhu ha mavuno yake. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Chihanda mbeyu ya chimuhe mgati yenu. Si mbuli ng'hulu chihagobola vinhu vovilondeka kwa chila zuwa kulawa kumwenu. <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>One wanhu wamwenga wolondeka kulolela yayo kulawa kumwenu. Cheye china haki ng'hani kufosa wawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Mbali cheye hachiisang'hanile haki ino. Badala yake, chifunyila umoyo chila chinhu muladi sekechike ching'waso chochose muna inzila ya Mbuli Inogile ya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Vino hamuvimanyile kuwa wanhu wasang'hani muna Ikaye ya Mulungu wopata ndiya kulawa muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, na waja wolava zabihu muna ichilingo wopata hanhu ha zabihu iyo? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Iviya Mndewa kachilagiliza kuwa wanhu wopeta Mbuli Inogile wapate ndiya zao kulawa muna Imbuli Inogile.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Mbali niye sisang'hanile hata imwe ya haki zino, na wala sandika muladi nipate haki zino. Muhavu nidanganike! Habule munhu yodaha kusegeza magoda yangu. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Silondeka kuigoda kwaviya nopeta Mbuli Inogile. Iyo ni sang'hano ining'higwe. Na nizagaya one siwapetele wanhu Mbuli Inogile! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>One notenda sang'hano ino kwa kulonda mwenyewo, nina gweko, mbali one notenda sang'hano iyo siyo kwa kulonda mwenyewo, Mulungu kaning'ha iyo niitende. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Lelo yombe jangu ni chinhu chaki? Yombe jangu ni kuwapetele wanhu Mbuli Inogile bila kulihigwa. Bila kupula chonilondeka kupata kwa sang'hano yangu ya Mbuli Inogile.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Niye niilegeha, sili mtumwa wa munhu yoyose, mbali niitenda mwenyewo kuwa mtumwa wa chila munhu muladi kuhuma fana vidahika na wanhu wengi wamuhuwila Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Vinikalile kwa Wayahudi niitenda fana Muyahudi muladi niwagaluse Wayahudi, ingawa silangulizigwa na malagilizo ya Musa, nikala nolangulizigwa na malagilizo kumwawo muladi niwagaluse waja wowalangilizigwa na malagilizo. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Kwa waja weli kunze ya malagilizo ya Musa, nokala kunze ya malagilizo fana wawo, muladi niwapate wawo weli kunze ya malagilizo. Ino haifambula kuwa niye nakunze ya malagilizo ya Mulungu, nokala hasi ya Malagilizo ya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Kwa waja weli na uhuwilo nyondenyonde niwa na uhuwilo nyondenyonde fana wawo, muladi niwapate. Ivo niwa na vinhu vose kwa wanhu wose, muladi wawo wakomboligwe kwa chila nzila.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Notenda yayo yose kwa ichimu cha Mbuli Inogile, muladi nipate hanhu ha balaka zake. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Muvimanya wakimbilaji wengi wokimbila mbali yosola gweko ni imwe muhala. Basi mukimbile mbaka mpate gweko. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Na chila munhu yoyotenda kuihuma muna umwangalo koikimiliza na vinhu vingi muna yamazoezi yake. Mbali wotenda vino kwa lungilo wapate gweko dodibanangika. Mbali cheye chotenda viya, muladi chipate gweko hadibanangika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Ivo nokimbila nihailungila kuhuma, ivo vichiigomba naniye fana munhu wa kuitowa voyokwasa ng'honde kuchanyha. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Nolwing'ha lukuli lwangu manhesa madala na kulugaza ng'hani muladi niye mwenyewo sekenilemigwe, maabaho kuwapetela usenga wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Zumo kusonhela kutambikila nyang'hiti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Ndugu zangu, mukumbuke yaja yoyawalawilile wasaho zetu wowamsondelele Musa. Wakala wokalizigwa na wingu, na wose waloka vinogile Ibahali Ndung'hu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Wose wabatizigwa muna diwingu na muna ibahali fana wanahina wa Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Wose waja ndiya ija ija ya chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>Wang'wa ching'waji chiyachiya cha chimuhe. Wang'wa mazi kulawa muna uluwe lwa chimuhe wowahitile nawo, na luwe uwo ukala Chilisito mwenyewo. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Mbali wengi wawo Mulungu hawanogele bule, ivo mitufi yawo ipwililisigwa kuna dibwilingu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Lelo mbuli zino zose ni simwe kumwetu, zochizuma sekechilonde vinhu vihile, fana wawo viwatendile. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Sekemutambikile nyang'hiti, fana wamwenga wawo viwatendile. Fana Yamaandiko Yelile viyolonga, “Wanhu wakala hasi kuja na kung'wa. Maabaho wema na kutenda mbuli za ugoni.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Sekechitende uzinzi fana wamwenga wawo viwatendile, wadanganika zuwa dimwe wanhu 23,000. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Sekechimgeze Mndewa Chilisito, fana viwamgezile wawo viwatendile, nawo wakomigwa na mazoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Sekechilongelele fana viwatendile wamwenga wawo, nawo wakomigwa na Msenga wa ifa wa katumigwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Ivo mbuli izo zilawilile kumwawo wawo, zikala chilaguso kwa wamwenga, na yandikigwa muladi kuchizuma. Cheye wochikala muna zisiku za habehi na uhelelo.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Wanhu wowogesa kuwa wema chigangamavu, waitiganye sekewagwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Magezo yongezigwa ni yakawaida kwa wanhu. Mbali Mulungu kokwaminika, nayo hezatogola mugezigwe kufosa nguvu zenu, mbali hamwe na kugezigwa, kezaweng'heni iviya nguvu ya kufunya umoyo na nzila ya kulawa umo vinogile.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Ivo ndugu zangu walondwa, muyepule na kutambikila nyang'hiti.<verse eid="1CO 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nolonga na mweye wanhu mwili na ubala, lamuleni mweye wenyewo yayo yonilonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Nhungo yochisang'hanila muna Indiya ya kukumbuka ifa ya Mndewa, na kwa iyo chomwing'ha hewela Mulungu. Chahang'wila nhungo ino, choilumba muna idamu ya Chilisito. Na gate dochimogola, chahadija, choilumba na lukuli lwa Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Kwaviya gate ni dimwe, cheye chili wengi ni lukuli lumwe, kwaviya cheye chose chohokela hanhu ha gate dimwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Waloleni wanhu wa Isilaeli, waja woja sadaka ya chilingo ni muilumba kwa iyo zabihu yoilavigwa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Lelo nilonge choni? Vino ndiya yoitambikiligwa nyang'hiti ni chinhu, hebu nyang'hiti ni chinhu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Si ivo bule! Chonilonga ni kuwa zabihu zowolava wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu wowalavila vinyamkela, si Mulungu bule. Na silonda mweye muilumbe na vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Hamudaha bule kung'wa nhungo ya Mndewa na iviya kung'wa nhungo ya vinyamkela, hamudaha kuja muna imeza ya Mndewa na iviya muna imeza ya vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>One chihatenda ivo chizamtenda Mndewa yawe na migongo. Cheye chabule nguvu kufosa yeye. <verse eid="1CO 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Ivo mweye molonga, “Chitogoliligwa kutenda chinhu chochose.” Mbali niye nolonga si chila chinhu chinoga. Mweye molonga “Chitogoliligwa kutenda chinhu chochose.” Mbali niye nolonga si chila chinhu chotaza. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Chila munhu vumwili sekeyazahile malondo yake mwenyewo muhala, mbali malondo ya wayage.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Diyeni chinhu chochose chochichuuzigwa kudigulilo bila kuuzauza kwa ichimu cha lungilo jenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Kwaviya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Isi na chila chinhu chili umo ni cha Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>One munhu hahuwila bule yahawagoneka mukaje ndiya na molonda kuhita, diyeni chila chinhu chikigwe kuulongozi wenu, bila kuuzauza kwa ichimu cha lungilo jenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Mbali one munhu imwenga yahamulongelani, “Ndiya ino itambikiligwa nyang'hiti,” Sekemuje ndiya iyo, kwa ichimu cha munhu yamulongeleni na lungilo. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Nolonga, lungilo mbali siyo jako ila da ija imwenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Sizasang'hanila ulegeho wangu one uhatenda lungilo da munhu imwenga dinitaguse. <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Sija ndiya ilavigwe hewela kwa Mulungu, one munhu imwenga yoyose yahaniliga kwa ichimu cha ndiya yoniilavila hewela kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Ivo chochose chomutenda, iwe kuja hebu kung'wa, tendeni yano yose kwa utunhizo wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Sekemumtende munhu yoyose yaikwale, Wayahudi hebu wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi hebu kwa bumbila da wanhu womuhuwila Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Tendeni fana vonitenda niye, nogeza kumnogela chila munhu kwa yose yonitenda kwaviya silonda yaja yoninogela niye, mbali nolonda yaja yowanogela wanhu wose muladi wadahe kukomboligwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Niwinze niye fana niye vinimuwinza Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugubika ditwi lusita lwa kutambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nomtogozani, kwaviya monikumbuka muna ichila chinhu na kusondelela mafundizo yoniweng'hile. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Mbali nolonda muvimanye kuwa ditwi da mulume ni Chilisito, na ditwi da mwanamke ni mulume, na ditwi da Chilisito ni Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Chila mulume yahatosa hebu yahagong'onda usenga wa Mulungu haulongozi wa wanhu kuno kagubika ditwi jake iyo komzeha Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Mwanamke yahatosa hebu yahagong'onda usenga wa Mulungu haulongozi wa wanhu bila kugubika ditwi jake, komzeha mulumake, baho habule mbasakanyo kati ya mwanamke iyo na mwanamke yawegule. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>One mwanamke haigubika ditwi jake, muhavu yawegule. Mbali ni chinyala kwa mwanamke yasenye hebu yawegule, muhavu yagubike ditwi jake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Mulume halondeka kugubika ditwi jake, kwaviya yeye kalinga Mulungu na yeye kobamila utunhizo wa Mulungu. Mbali mwanamke kobamila ukulu wa mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Kwaviya mulume halumbigwe kulawa kwa mwanamke, mbali mwanamke kalumbigwa kulawa kwa mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Kwaviya mulume halumbigwe kwa ichimu cha mwanamke, ila mwanamke kalumbigwa kwa ichimu cha mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Ivo kwa ichimu cha wasenga wa kuulanga, mwanamke kolondeka kugubika ditwi jake kuwa chilaguso chochilagusa kuwa kahasi ya udaho wa mulume wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Mbali muna ugima wetu kwa kuilumba na Mndewa, mwanamke siyo chinhu bila ya mulume, wala mulume siyo chinhu bila ya muke. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Fana viya mwanamke viyalumbigwe kulawa kwa mulume, ivo ivo na mulume kelekigwa na muke, mbali chila chinhu cholawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Lamuleni mweye wenyewo na mwizatogola one vinoga mwanamke yagubike ditwi jake yahatosa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Hata kulingwa kwenywewo yolagusa kuwa ni chinyala mulume kuwa na mvili nhali, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>mbali mwanamke kuwa na mvili nhali ni utunhizo kumwake. Kwaviya keng'higwa mvili nhali muladi zimgubike. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Na one munhu yoyose yahalonda kulema kutogola kwa mbuli iyo, ivo yavimanye kuwa cheye chabule chihendo chimwenga chochose cha nhambiko fana icho wala bumbila da wahuwila wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ya kukumbuka ifa ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Masayo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maliki 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Nihawa ning'hali nomwing'hani malagilizo yano, simtogozani kwaviya miting'hano yenu ya nhambiko yogala yehile ng'hani kufosa vinhu vinogile. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Baho mwanduso nihulika kuwa vomuiting'hana hamwe mweye kwa mweye fana wahuwila moiswela, na niye notogola chidogo. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Kwaviya lazima magesa ya mbasakanyo yawoneke kumwenu muladi waja wowotogoligwa na Mulungu wadahe kuwoneka. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Ivo mweye vomuiting'ha na hamwe fana chibumbila, mogesa kuwa moja ndiya kwa ichimu cha kumbukumbu ya Mndewa humbe siyo. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Kwaviya vomuja, chila munhu kolongolela kusola ndiya yake. Ivo munhu imwenga kana nzala, na imwenga kakoligwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Kweli muna kaye za kudila na kung'wila na sekemudizehe bumbila da wanhu wa Mulungu na kuwaguma chinyala wawo welibule chinhu. Vino niwalongeleni choni? Nimwing'heni nhogolwa? Si ivo bule, sidaha kumwing'hani nhogolwa bule kwa mbuli iyo!<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Kwaviya mafundizo yonimwing'hileni niyahokela kulawa kwa Mndewa kuwa Mndewa Yesu, chilo chiya viyatuligwe kwa wanhu wehi, kasola gate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kadimogola, na kalonga, “Luno ulo lukuli lwangu, lolulavigwa kwa ichimu chenu. Tendeni vino kwa kunikumbuka niye.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Iviya, viyakomeleze kuja, kasola nhungo na kalonga, “Nhungo ino ni lagano da sambi da Mulungu, mwiidamu yangu. Tendeni vino chila muhang'wa kwa kunikumbuka niye.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Kwaviya chila vimuja gate dino na kuing'wila nhungo ino, moigong'onda ifa ya Mndewa mbaka vondayeze kaidi. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Ivo chila yoja gate ijo hebu kung'wila nhungo ya Mndewa bila ya kulondeka kezawoneka kahasanya lukuli na damu ya Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Mbali munhu nayaiuzagize mwenyeo teng'hu, maabaho yaje gate na kung'wila nhungo ino. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Kwaviya one wanhu hawamanyile fambulo da lukuli lwa Mndewa viwoja gate na kung'wila nhungo, woigalila nhaguso wawo wenyewo viwoja na kung'wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Lekamana wamwengawenu wanyondenyonde na watamu, na wengi wenu wadanganika.<verse eid="1CO 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>One chahaitagusa wenyewo teng'hu, sigambe chitagusigwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Mndewa kolamula nhaguso na kuchitagusa, muladi sekechilamuliligwe nhaguso hamwe na wanhu wa isi yose.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Kwa ivo ndugu zangu, vomuiting'hana hamwe kuja Ndiya ya Mndewa, muigozele. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>One munhu yoyose yahawa na nzala, kolondeka yaje ukaye yake, muladi vondamuiting'hane sekeyatagusigwe. Na vondanize nizaweng'ha malagilizo yoyasigale.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Vitumetume va Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Lelo ndugu zangu kwa mbuli za vitumetume va Muhe Yelile nolonda muvimanye mbuli zino. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Nolonda mkumbuke kuwa vimkalile mung'hali hamunammanya Mulungu, musoligwa kutambikila nyang'hiti hazilonga, fana vimulangulizigwe na nyang'hiti. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Ivo nolonda muvimanye kuwa habule munhu yolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu yodaha kulonga “Yesu yaduwiligwe!” Habule munhu yoyodaha kutogola kuwa “Yesu ni Mndewa,” Ila yawe kolangulizigwa na Muhe Yelile.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Kuna vitumetume mbasakanyo, mbali Muhe yoyoweng'ha ni imwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Kuna mbasakanyo mwingi wa kusang'hanila mbali Mndewa yosang'haniligwa niimwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Kuna sang'hano mbasakanyo, mbali Mulungu ni imwe yowadahiza wose kutenda sang'hano zawo. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Chila munhu kokwing'higwa lugubulo lwa Muhe Yelile, kwaichimu cha wanhu wose. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Muhe komwing'ha munhu imwe usenga wa ubala, na munhu imwenga kokwing'higwa usenga wa umanyi na Muhe iyoiyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Muhe iyo iyo komwing'ha imwenga uhuwilo na komwing'ha imwenga chitumetume cha kuhonya utamu. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Muhe Yelile komwing'ha munhu imwe nguvu ya kutenda mauzauza, na imwenga chitumetume cha kulotela usenga wa Mulungu, na imwenga udaho wa kuvimanya mbasakanyo ya mihe ya uvwizi na Muhe wa kweli. Na imwenga keng'higwa udaho wa kulonga ulonzi wa kwazanya, na imwenga udaho wa kufambula ulonzi umwenga. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Mbali Muhe Yelile ni ija ija imwe yoyotenda vinhu vino vose, komwing'ha chila munhu chitumetume mbasakanyo fana viyolonda Muhe Yelile.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lumwe luna vilungo vingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Chilisito ni fana viya lukuli lumwe lwili na vilungo vingi, ingawa utendigwa muna ivilungo mbasakanyo lung'hali lukuli lumwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Cheye chose chibatizigwa kwa Muhe imwe muna ulukuli lumwe, kwa Wayahudi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi, kwa watumwa hebu kwa wailegehe na cheye chose ching'wizigwa na Muhe imwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Kwaviya lukuli lwenyewo hautendigwe kwa chilungo chimwe muhala, ila vilungo vingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>One mgulu wahalonga, “Kwaviya niye si mkono, niye si wa lukuli,” si wa lukuli kwa ichimu icho? <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Na one gutwi dihalonga, “Kwaviya niye sili ziso, niye si wa lukuli”, vino kwa ichimu icho sigambediwe chilungo cha lukuli? Siivo bule! <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Iviya one lukuli lose luhawile ziso, kuhulika kwa kulihi? Na one yahakalile magutwi muhala, lwahadahile vilihi kunusa? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Mbali Mulungu keka chila chilungo mbasakanyo muna ulukuli lwa munhu fana viyalondile. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>One vose viwile chilungo chimwe muhala, sigambe kuwe na lukuli. <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Fana viili, vilungo ni vingi mbali lukuli ni lumwe muhala.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Ivo ziso hadidaha kuulongela mkono, “Weye sikulonda!” Wala ditwi hadidaha kuilongela migulu, “Mweye simulondani!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Mbali, hachidaha kusang'hana bila vilungo va lukuli voviwoneka vinyondenyonde. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Na vilungo viya vichigesile kuwa havilondeka kwing'higwa hishima ng'hulu, ivo vochivilola goya ng'hani, vinhu va lukuli vili vilungo va chinyala ivo vichika goya ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Mbali vilungo vetu vinogile ng'hani havilondeka. Mbali Mulungu mwenyewo kalwika lukuli muna umpango, kaving'ha unovu ng'hani viungo viya vihungukilwe unovu, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>muladi sekekuwe na kuigola muna ulukuli, ila vilungo vose viigese. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>One chilungo chimwe chahalumila, viungo vimwenga vose volumila hamwe nacho, na one chiungo chimwe chihahishimigwa, viungo vimwenga vose vodeng'helela hamwe nacho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Ivo mweye mose ni lukuli lwa Chilisito, na chila imwe wenu ni chilungo cha lukuli ulo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Na muna yamakanisa ya Mulungu kaweka teng'hu watumigwa na wekaidi ni walotezi na wekatatu ni wafundiza, maabaho wanhu wotenda mauzauza, wanhu weli na chitumetume cha kuhonya hebu kuwataza wamwenga hebu kuwalanguliza hebu kulonga ulonzi wa kwazanya. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Wanhu wose si watumigwa hebu walotezi hebu wafundiza. Si chila munhu kana udaho wa kutenda mauzauza. <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Siyo wanhu wose weng'higwa chitumetume cha kuhonya mitamu hebu kulonga ulonzi wa kwazanya hebu kufambula ulonzi lumwenga. <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Londeni ng'hani vitumetume vinogile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Na sambi nizamulagusani nzila inogile ng'hani kufosa zose.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ulondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Nodaha kulonga ulonzi wa wanhu na wasenga wa kuulanga, mbali one nabule ulondo niye nilinga fana dizi da mbugi hebu da pegwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Nodaha kuwa na chitumetume cha kulotela usenga wa Mulungu, na nodaha kuwa na umanyi wose na kuvimanya vinhu vose vifisigwe, nodaha kuwa na uhuwilo wa kudaha kuhamiza migongo, mbali one nabule ulondo, niye si chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Nodaha kulava chila chinhu chonilinacho, na kuweng'ha ngayengaye, hata kulava lukuli lwangu lulunguzigwe na moto, mbali one nabule ulondo, iyo haifaya chochose kumwangu.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Munhu yeli na ulondo kofunya umoyo na kotaza, kabule migongo hebu matopa na haigoda. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Munhu yeli na ulondo hapuwa hishima na hazahila faida yake mwenyewo na hakawa kupata ludoko na hapeta yehile. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Munhu yeli na ulondo hadeng'helela yehile, mbali kodeng'helela yanogile. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Munhu yeli na ulondo wokwehula yose, kololela yose, kohuwila yose, na kofunya umoyo siku zose.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Ulondo wabule uhelelo. Usenga wenyewo wolotela wizaleka, na ulonzi wa kwazanya wizaleka kulongigwa. Vose vochivimanya vizabanangigwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kwaviya chitumetume chetu cha umanyi ni chidodo, na chitumetume chetu cha ulotezi ni chidogo, <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>mbali vondachize chiya chikamilike, vose vili havikamilike vizahalawa.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Vinikalile mwana nilonga fana mwana, nivimanya fana mwana, nigesa fana mwana. Viniwile mkulu, mbuli za uwana nizileka. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Chochichiwona sambi ni fana munhu yoilola muna ichilole chifilile, mbali baho hamwande chizawona chihanga kwa chihanga. Sambi novimanya hakinakwenela, mbali baho hamwande yose nizayamanya hakinakwenela fana viya Mulungu viyonimanya niye.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Vinhu vino vitatu vokala siku zose, uhuwilo na lolelo na ulondo. Na dili kulu kufosa yose ni ulondo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zimwenga vitumetume kulawa kwa Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Usondeleleni ng'hani ulondo, na kulonda ng'hani vitumetume va chimuhe kulawa kwa Muhe Yelile, haswa chitumetume cha kulotela. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Munhu yolonga kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya, halonga na wanhu mbali wolonga na Mulungu, kwaviya habule munhu yoyose yommanya. Wolonga mbuli zifisigwe zili muna muhe wake. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Mbali waja wolotela wolonga na wanhu na kuwataza, wowaguma moyo na kuwagangamiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Waja wolonga ulonzi wa kwazanya woigangamiza wenyewo, mbali waja wolotela wodigangamiza bumbila da wanhu wowomuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Nolonda wose mulonge kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya, mbali nihalondile ng'hani muwe na chitumetume cha kulotela, kwaviya munhu mwene chitumetume cha kulotela ni wa mana ng'hani kufosa iyo yolonga kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya, ila one kabaho munhu yodaha kuzifambula mbuli izo ziyolonga muladi wahuwila watazigwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Ivo ndugu zangu one niheza kumwenu na kulonga na mweye kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya izafaya choni? Haizawafaya chochose, mbali one nihamulongelani lugubulo lwa Mulungu, hebu umanyi umwenga, hebu ulotezi hebu mafundizo yamwenga.<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Hata vinhu vilibule ugima vovilava dizi, ihawa chilonge longe, ihawa chilimba, one havilavile dizi dili na mbasakanyo. Izatambuligwa ni wila ulihi woutowigwa na chilongelonge hebu kwa chimbeta. <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Na one mhalati ihalava dizi hadimanyika, yelihi yondayaisasale goya kwa ng'hondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Iviya, na mweye one lulimi lwenu haulonga chinhu cha kumanyika, yelihi yondayadahe kuyamanya yomulonga? Mbuli zenu zizakwaga bule! <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Kuna ulonzi mwingi mbasakanyo muna isi, na habule ulonzi haumanyika. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>One siumanyile ulonzi woulongigwa, wanhu wolonga ulonzi uwo wezakuwa wageni kumwangu na niye nizakuwa mgeni kumwawo. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Ivo na mweye, kwaviya molonda ng'hani kuwa wanhu weli na chitume tume cha Muhe Yelile, londeni ng'hani kuwa muiyohe ng'hani kuwa nazo muladi kudigangamiza bumbila da wanhu wowomuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Ivo munhu yolonga ulonzi wa kwazanya, kolondeka yapule chitumetume cha kufambula chiya chiyolonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Kwaichimu chino one nihatosa kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya, muhe wangu wotosa, mbali nzewele zangu hazisang'hana chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Vino nitende choni? Nizatosa kwa muhe wangu, mbali iviya nizatosa kwa nzewele zangu, nizakwimba kwa muhe wangu, mbali iviya nizakwimba kwa nzewele zangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>One kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa muhe muhala, wanhu hawavimanyile bule hawadaha kulonga “Ivo” kwa kumwing'ha kwako hewela Mulungu, kwaviya hawavimanya bule chiulonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Nhambiko yako ya kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu yodaha kuwa inoga kweli, mbali wanhu wamwenga haizawagangamiza bule.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwaviya nolonga ulonzi wa kwazanya kufosa mweye wose. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Mbali muna yamabumbila ya wahuwila wa Chilisito nolonda kulonga mbuli tano zozidaha kumanyika, muladi nidahe kuwafundiza wamwenga, kufosa kulonga mbuli elufu longo kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Ndugu zangu, lekeni kugesa fana wana, muwe wana ving'hele muna uwihi, mbali mukule muna ukugesa. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Yandikigwa vino muna yamalagilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Mndewa kolonga, nizalonga kwa nzila ya wanhu wolonga ulonzi wa kwazanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">nizalonga na wanhu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Nizalonga kwa milomo ya wageni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">mbali wanhu wangu hawezanitegeleza bule.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Ivo chitume tume kulawa kwa Mulungu cha kulonga ulonzi wa kwazanya ni chilaguso, si kwa ichimu cha wanhu weli na uhuwilo mbali kwa waja welibule uhuwilo, mbali chitume tume cha kulotela kwa ichimu cha waja wohuwila na si kwa ichimu cha welibule uhuwilo.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>One wahuwila wose woiting'hana hamwe, na chila munhu kokwandusa kulonga ulonzi wa kwazanya, vino one waheza wanhu hawavimanyile na welibule uhuwilo, hawezalonga kuwa mweye wose muna vichala? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Mbali one chila munhu yahawa kolotela usenga yoyeng'higwe na Mulungu, yaheza munhu havimanyile hebu munhu hahuwila, yose yondayayahulike yezalagusa wihi wake mwenyewo, yose yondayayahulike kezamulamulila nhaguso, <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Mbuli zifisigwe muna imizoyo yawo zizalagusigwa funhufunhu, na kezatumbala mavindi na kutambika kwa Mulungu, kezalonga, “Kweli Mulungu kabahano hagati yenu!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutambika voilondeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Ndugu zangu nolonga vino. Mwahaiting'hana hamwe kumtambika Mulungu, imwe yembe wila, imwenga yalave mafundizo, imwenga yasang'hanile chitumetume kulawa kwa Mulungu cha kulonga ulonzi wa kwazanya, na imwenga yawe na magubulo kulawa kwa Mulungu, na imwenga yafambule yoyolongigwa. Yose yawe kwa kuwataza wahuwila wa Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>One munhu yahalonga ulonzi wa kwazanywa, walonge waidi hebu watatu, imwe imwe, na imwenga yafambule <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Mbali one munhu yodaha kufambula kahabule, munhu yolonga ulonzi wa kwazanya nayanyamale, yalonge yaidumwe na Mulungu wake. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Walotezi wa Mulungu waidi hebu watatu wodaha kulonga, wamwenga walamule na yaja yolongigwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Mbali one kuhawa na munhu yakalile muna umting'hano kohokela lugubulo kwa Mulungu, munhu yolonga kolondeka yanyamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Kwaviya mweye wose modaha kulotela, imwe imwe, muladi chila munhu yaifunze na kugangamizigwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Chitumetume cha ulotezi cholondeka chitawaligwe na mulotezi mwenyewo. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Kwaviya Mulungu siyo Mulungu wa tibwilitibwili mbali wa tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Iviya fana viili muna yamabumbila ya wanhu welile womuhuwila Chilisito, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>wanaake wolondeka wakale hupi muna imiting'hano. Hawalondeka kulonga, wolondeka kutegeleza fana viyalonga Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>One wahalonda kuvimanya chinhu chochose, wolondeka wawauze walume zawo muna zikaye zawo. Ni mbuli ya chinyala ng'hani muke kulonga muna imiting'hano ya mabumbila ya wanhu wowomuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Hebu mbuli ya Mulungu ilawa kumwenu? Hebu imfikilani mweye muhala? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>One munhu yoyose yahagesa kuwa yeye ni mulotezi, hebu kana chitumetume cha Muhe Yelile, yavimanye kuwa yano yonimwandikilani mweye ni lagilizo da Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Mbali one munhu hategeleze yano, nayo sekemumtegeleze.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Ivo ndugu zangu molondeka kuwa na hamu ya kulotela, mbali sekemumulemese munhu kulonga kwa ulonzi wa kwazanya. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Chila chinhu cholondeka chitendeke kwa ugoya na utalatibu.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Uzilibuko wa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Na sambi ndugu zangu nolonda kumkumbusani Mbuli Inogile iniwapeteleni, yomuihokele iyo chandusilo cha uhuwilo wenu wima chigangamavu. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Kwa Mbuli ino Inogile mokomboligwa, one muhamha mbuli zonimpeteleni. One si ivo muhuwila bule.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Nimwing'hani mweye vinhu vovilondeka ng'hani vinihokele, kuwa Chilisito kadanganika kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wetu, fana viyandikigwe muna Yamaandiko Yelile, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>kawandigwa na zuwa dekatatu kazilibuka, fana viyandikigwe muna Yamaandiko Yelile, <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Mwanduso kamulawilila Petili <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zina jake ni Kefa</char></note> na maabaho kawalawilila waja watumigwa longo na waidi. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Maabaho kawalawilila wahuwila wengi kufosa magana matano hamwe, wamwenga wawo wang'hali wagima mbaka sambi, ingawa wamwenga viweli wawandigwa wamala. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Maabaho kamulawilila Yakobo, maabaho kawalawilila watumigwa wose.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Kuuhelelo wa yose kanilawila niye iviya, nikala fana viya munhu yavumbuligwe lusita silwake. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kwaviya niye namdodo mwa watumigwa wose, sifaya hata kutangigwa mtumigwa, kwaviya nidigaza bumbila da wanhu wowomuhuwila Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Mbali kwa unovu wa Mulungu niwa vino vinili, na unovu uyaning'hile uwa si bule, ila niiyoha ng'hani kusang'hana usang'hano kufosa watumigwa wose, ingawa haikalile sang'hano yangu mwenyewo, mbali unovu wa Mulungu wosang'hana hamwe na niye. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Mbali one ihawa niye hebu wawo, chino niicho chochipeta, na chino niicho chimuhuwile.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uzilibuko wetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Mbali fana yopetigwa kuwa Chilisito kazilibuka, vilihi wamwenga wenu wolonga kuwa wanhu wadanganike hawezazilibuka bule? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>One habule kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wadanganike, basi na Chilisito nayo hazilibuke bule. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>One Chilisito hazilibuke, basi kupetela kwetu si chinhu na uhuwilo wenu si chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Kufosa yayo, cheye chowoneka wakalangama wa uvwizi wa Mulungu, kwaviya chilonga Mulungu kanzilibula Chilisito, mbali one kweli kuwa wanhu wadanganike hawazilibuligwa bule, basi Mulungu hamzilibule Chilisito bule. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Kwaviya one wanhu wadanganike hawazilibuka, basi Chilisito hazilibuke bule. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Iviya Chilisito hazilibuke, basi uhuwilo wenu si chinhu na mung'hali muna uhasanyi wenu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Na waja wose wadanganike wahawa wailumba na Chilisito waga ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Ihawa chomulolela ng'hani Chilisito muna ugima uno muhala, basi cheye cha wanhu wa kuwoneligwa ubazi ng'hani kufosa wamwenga wose muna isi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Mbali Chilisito kweli kazilibuka, wamwanduso wawo kwa waja wagonile muna iifa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Fana viya ifa viigaligwe mwiisi na munhu imwe, ivo ivo na kuzilibuka kugaligwa na munhu imwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Fana viya wanhu wose viwodanganika kwa kuilumba na Adamu, ivo ivo wanhu wose wezazilibuka kwa kuilumba na Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Mbali chila munhu kwa mpango wake, mwanduso Chilisito maabaho waja weli wake Chilisito chipindi chondayeze. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Maabaho uhelelo wizakwiza, Chilisito vondayamwing'he Ufalume Mulungu Tata. Vondayabanange tawala zose, udaho na nguvu. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Kwaviya Chilisito kolondeka yatawale, mbaka Mulungu vondayaweke wehi wose hasi ya migulu yake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Mwihi wa uhelelo yondayabanangigwe kezakuwa ifa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Kwaviya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Mulungu keka vinhu vose hasi ya migulu yake.” Ukweli uno ni kuwa, Mulungu hengila muna dibumbila ijo da vinhu, kwaviya yeye iyo yovika vinhu vose hasi ya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Mbali vinhu vose hondavikigwe hasi ya utawala wa Chilisito, nayo mwenyewo, Mwana, kezaika yeye mwenyewo hasi ya Mulungu, yoyekile vinhu vose hasi yake, na Mulungu kezatawala vinhu vose ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Lelo wezapata choni waja wabatizigwe kwa ichimu cha wanhu wadanganike? One ihawa kweli kuwa wanhu wadanganike hawazilibuka bule, habali wanhu wawo wabatizigwa kwa ichimu cha wanhu wadanganike? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Habali choika muna ing'hondo cheye wenyewo chila lusita? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Ndugu zangu kweli nowona ifa chila zuwa! Vino voniigoda kumwenu, muna ugima wetu kwa kuilumba na Chilisito Yesu Mndewa wetu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>One chimu changu chahawile cha chiunhu muhala, kuja kuitowa kwangu na wanhu wowakalile fana “wanyama wakali” muna Efeso kuhanifaiye choni? One wanhu wadanganike hawazilibuligwa, basi, “Chije na ching'we, kwaviya igolo chizadanganika.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Sekemuvwiziligwe. “Umbwiya wihile wobananga luzowe lunogile.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Galuleni magesa yenu yanogile! Kanduseni kukala goya na lekeni kutenda uhasanyi. Wamwenga wenu hawammanyile Mulungu hata chidogo. Nomulongelani, ni chinyala ng'hani kumwenu!<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'huli zetu zizazilibuligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Munhu kezauza, “Wanhu wadanganike wezazilibuligwa vilihi? Wezakuwa na ng'huli zaki?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Mweye wabozi! Mohahanda mbeyu muna isi one haifile haizakota. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Chomuhanda ni mbeyu muhala, iwe ya uhemba hebu mbeyu imwenga, na si mbiki ngima wondaulawilile hamwande. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Na Mulungu koing'ha mbeyu iyo sina doyolonda mwenyewo, chila mbeyu yopata sina jake yenyewo.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Ng'huli zose si zimwe, wanhu wana ng'huli modeli umwenga, mang'onyo yana ng'huli modeli umwenga, ndege wana ng'huli modeli umwenga, somba wana ng'huli modeli umwenga.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Iviya kuna ng'huli za kuulanga na ng'huli za mwiisi, mbali unovu wa ng'huli za kuulanga ni umwenga na unovu wa ng'huli za muna isi ni umwenga. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Kuna unovu wa zuwa na wa mwezi, na wa nhondo, iviya nhondo nazo zoisosokanya kwa utunhizo.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Vino ivo vondaiwe wanhu vondawazilibuligwe. Fana viya mbeyu, lukuli lowandigwa muna umsanga, lowola. Luhazilibuka, haluwola. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Lowandigwa mwiihali ya chinyala na lozilibuligwa mwiihali ya utunhizo, lowandigwa mwihali ya unyondenyonde na lozilibuligwa na ludabwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Zowandigwa ng'huli za chiunhu, na zozilibuligwa ng'huli za chimuhe. One kuhawa na lukuli lwa chiunhu basi iviya kuna lukuli lwa chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Kwaviya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, “Munhu wa ichanduso, Adamu, kakala munhu mwene ugima,” mbali Adamu wa kuuhelelo ni Muhe yoyoweng'ha wanhu ugima. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Ivo lukuli lwa chimuhe si ulo lulongole, mbali lwa chiunhu ulo lulongole, maabaho ulo wa chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Adamu wa mwanduso kalumbigwa na timbwisi kulawa mwiisi, na Adamu wekaidi kalawa kuulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Wose weli wa isi walinga fana munhu iyo yoyalumbigwe kwa timbwisi, na waja weli kuulanga walinga fana munhu ija yalawile kuulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Fana viya vichilingile munhu ija yoyalumbigwe kwa timbwisi, ivo ivo chizalinga fana munhu ija yoyalawile kuulanga.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Ivo ndugu nolonga vino, chiya chochitendigwe kwa lukuli na damu, havidaha kuhazi ufalume wa Mulungu, na vinhu vene kuwola havidaha kuhazi vinhu va kuwola.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Tegelezeni nomulongelani sili, cheye chose hachizadanganika, mbali chose chizagalusigwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Lusita lumwe kufinyiliza lwa mhalati ya kuuhelelo, kwaviya mhalati izalila, na wanhu wadanganike wezazilibuligwa na hawezadanganika kaidi muna ukupotigwa, na cheye chizagalusigwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Kwaviya yolondeka chila chiwola chiilawalile hali ya kuleka kuwola, na lukuli loludaha kudanganika luvale lukuli haludanganika. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Ivo wene kuwola vondauyawale kuleka kuwola na luno lwa kudanganika vondaluyawale kuleka udanganika, bahobaho hondaiwe mbuli ija iyandikigwe, “Ifa imeligwa kwa kuhuma!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“Ifa, uhumi wako wa kulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Udaho wako wa kulumiza wakulihi?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Ifa yopata ludabwa lwa kulumiza kulawa muna uhasanyi, na uhasanyi wopata ludabwa lwake kulawa muna yamalagilizo ya Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Mbali chomwing'ha hewela Mulungu yoyoching'ha uhumi kwa nzila ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Ivo ndugu zangu walondwa, mgangamale, sekemutingisike, muiyohe ng'hani kusang'hana usang'hano wa Mndewa siku zose, kwaviya sang'hano yenu kwa Mndewa si bule.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya kuwataza ndugu wahuwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Lelo kwa mbuli ya sadaka kwa wanhu wa Mulungu. Tendeni fana viniwalongele bumbila da wahuwila wa Galatiya watende. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Chila jumapili, chila imwe wenu kolondeka yabagule hela zimwenga kadili viyopata, muladi sekehawe na sangizo vondanize. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Na niye vondanize, nizawatuma waja wondaniwasagule vomuli wagale usenga na vitumetume venu uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>One izafaya na niye nihite iviya, basi wezahita hamwe na niye.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mipango ya Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Mbali nizakwiza kumwenu nihakomeleza kufosela Makedoniya, kwaviya nolonda kufosela Makedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Yahadahika nizakala kumwenu kwa lusita, hebu ihadahika nizakala hamwe na mweye miyezi yose ya chihuhe, muladi mupate kunhaza nigendelele na mwanza hohose hondanihite. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Kwaviya silonda kuiyona na mweye kwa kufosa muhala. Nololela kukala na mweye lusita ludodo Mndewa yahalonda.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Nizakala hano muna dibululu da Efeso mbaka zuwa da Pendekosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Lwivi luvuguligwa kwa usang'hano wangu unogile hano, ingawa wonilema ni wengi.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timoseyo yaheza, muloleni yakale kumwenu bila kudumba, kwaviya kosang'hana usang'hano wa Mndewa fana niye. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Munhu yoyose sekeyamwehule, ila mtazeni yagendelele na mwanza wake kwa tindiwalo, muladi yabwele kumwangu, kwaviya niye nogozela hamwe na ndugu zangu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Mbali kwa mbuli za Apolo ndugu yetu, nimulamba ng'hani yahite kumwenu hamwe na ndugu wamwenga, ija halondile kuhita sambi, mbali kezakwiza hondayapate nyafasi.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za uhelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Kaleni meso, imeni chiugangamavu muna uhuwilo, muwe magalu na wene nguvu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Tendeni chila chinhu kwa ulondo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Movimanya kusonhela Sitefano na kaye yake, wawo ni wahuwila wa mwanduso kumuhuwila Kilisito muna isi ya Akaya na wailava wenyewo kuwasang'hanila wanhu wa Mulungu. Nowalamba ndugu zangu, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>muwategeleze wanhu fana wano, munhu imwenga yoyose yosang'hana usang'hano na kusang'hanila hamwe na wawo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Na niye nodeng'helela kwa ichimu cha kwiza kwa Sitefano na Fotunata na Akaiko, kwaviya wano waziba hengo dikalile uko kwa kuleka kuwauko ukwenu. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Waunogeza muhe wangu fana viya viwagumile moyo mweye wenyewo, yolondeka kuwahishimu wanhu wano.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Mabumbila yose ya wahuwila weli muna mkowa wa Asiya womulamusani kwa zina da Mndewa. Akila na Pilisika na wahuwila waja woiting'hana muna izikaye zawo womulamsani. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Wahuwila wose weli hano womulamusani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Ilamuseni mweye kwa mweye kwa chilaguso chelile cha ulondo.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Ndamsa ino noyandika niye mwenyewo Paulo kwa mkono wangu.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Munhu yoyose hamulonda Mndewa nayaduwiligwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Malanata, maana yake Bwana wetu njoo.</char>
    </note> Mndewa wetu, izo! <verse eid="1CO 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Unovu wa Mndewa Yesu na uwe hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Ulondo wangu uwe na mweye mose muna Ichilisito Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
